WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.035
-Finally, as we mentioned,

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:05.271
the Alabama legislature
voted yesterday

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.840
to almost entirely ban abortion
in their state.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.443
It's the most sweeping abortion
ban seen in the U.S.

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.644
since Roe v. Wade.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.446
Here to talk about it
is one of our writers,

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.014
Amber Ruffin.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.849
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:21.287
-Hi, Seth.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:24.390
-Hey, Amber. What's going on?

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.194
-Well, I no longer have control
over my own body!

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.662
That's what's going on.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.999
I want to talk about abortion,
but I have to do it like this.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.667
-Yeah, but you don't live in
Alabama.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.002
This law doesn't apply to you.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.771
-No, but this is where our
country is headed.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:42.208
So we figured we may as well get
some practice.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.343
-All right. Let's talk about it.

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:47.714
-Alabama's new law makes it
almost impossible for a woman to

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.015
get an abortion.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.618
You can't get one.
You can't get one.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.687
No one can get an abortion!

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.555
-I mean, this is really serious,
right?

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:58.024
-I know.

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:01.594
And Republicans designed the
bill to be challenged in courts

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.796
so that they can try to overturn

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.633
Roe versus Wade.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.270
It's a scary time to be a woman.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.638
I'm scared.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:13.539
-I bet.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:14.940
-I have a question.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.076
-Oh, yeah. Yes?

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:20.145
-If Alabama is going to force
women to have babies,

00:01:20.145 --> 00:01:23.316
are they going to help them
take care of them?

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:28.220
-No! Alabama has no paid family
leave laws.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.156
-What?!
-I know.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.693
-I'm shocked!
-I know!

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.828
-Then who's going to help
care for these babies

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:39.766
and feed them
and rock them to sleep?

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.569
Wait. I'm sorry. You think
that's how you rock a baby?

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:44.136
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:45.905
-I -- I don't know. I'm a man.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.073
We don't know this kind of
stuff.

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:49.141
-Yeah, no [bleep]

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:52.812
-What does it feel like to be
a woman in America right now?

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:55.648
-I can tell you what it feels
like.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.784
It feels like you're not even
a person.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.819
Like you have been stripped
of your humanity.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.420
That you are not valued
by the men

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.256
who were elected to serve you.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.791
And it makes you wonder where
you'll get the strength

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.060
to fight the battles
that need fighting.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.863
-Wow, that's really powerful,
but, um,

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:12.698
why are you lying on the floor?

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:15.001
-Oh, my guy's stuck in traffic.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.803
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:19.272
-I see.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:24.810
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.479
-We hear a lot about what
women are doing

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:30.249
to fighting anti-choice laws,
but what could men do?

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:32.118
-Elect women!

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:34.020
-Elect women!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.988
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:37.389
-Great idea. Give it up

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:39.192
for the women of "Late Night,"
everybody!

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:40.593
[ Cheers and applause ]

